louts, I will transcend the boss himself.

344
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:46,680
And you shall be by my side,
because you are strong.

345
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:49,320
Giorno's here. I must go.

346
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:50,816
Just one more thing.

347
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:54,680
I want you to know that you
are very dear to me, Sekko.

348
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:56,620
